# UI & Styling Conventions

## Design System

- **Tailwind CSS v4** (config via CSS, no `tailwind.config.ts`)
- **shadcn/ui** New York style with neutral base color and CSS variables
- **Icons**: Lucide React (`lucide-react`)
- **Theme**: Light/dark via `next-themes` (system default)

## Layout Patterns

- Pages use `max-w-2xl mx-auto` (forms/settings) or `max-w-4xl mx-auto` (reporting)
- Vertical spacing: `space-y-6` between sections
- Cards (`Card`, `CardHeader`, `CardContent`) for grouping related content
- Secondary filter areas can use dashed muted cards with compact buttons/badges to stay visually light
- Responsive: mobile-first with `sm:` breakpoints

## Component Utilities

```typescript
import { cn } from "@/lib/utils"; // clsx + tailwind-merge

<div className={cn("base-classes", conditional && "extra-classes")} />
```

## Color Semantics

- Intensity colors (symptoms): green (1-3) → yellow (4-5) → orange (6-7) → red (8-10)
- Use helpers from `@/lib/date-utils`: `getIntensityColor()`, `getIntensityBgClass()`, `getIntensityTextClass()`
- Destructive actions: `variant="destructive"` or `text-destructive` / `border-destructive`

## Responsive Design

- Touch-friendly: swipe navigation between pages (`SwipeNavigator`)
- Button sizes adapt: `text-xs sm:text-sm`, `px-2 sm:px-3`
- Grid layouts: `grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2` or `sm:grid-cols-3`
- Hide/show elements: `hidden sm:block` / `sm:hidden`

## Adding shadcn Components

```bash
npx shadcn add <component-name>
```

Components are installed to `src/components/ui/`.
